      <activity id="545a136e-1680-5b35-9e27-bbd4b83c7f4d" activityNameId="48af605b-599f-508f-88fe-258fcdc34653" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Printed wiring board, mixed mounted, unspec., solder mix, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Printed wiring board, mixed mounted, unspec., solder mix, at plant
Data are based on own assumption - assuming a 50:50 mix between the two technologies (through-hole, surface mount); Geography: Own estimation - used for the global average; UUID: a4784452-6f6a-3f75-a1a1-a4e51102b94a
This dataset represents a mix of the two mounting technologies (surface mount / through-hole mount); using for each of them a dataset representing a solder mix of Pb-containing and Pb-free solder. It includes processes of components mounting using lead and lead free solder technology.
Location: Own estimation - used for the global average
Technology: Dataset represents the mix of lead and lead-free mounting of unspecified PWBs.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: own estimation
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a4784452-6f6a-3f75-a1a1-a4e51102b94a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
